{150}{Pelojian was born to great wealth, but his spirit was that of a wandering mystic. It would not allow him to live a life of leisure. When, in his travels, he found only arrogance, greed, and the thirst for power among the sorcerers of his day, it troubled his soul greatly. He wandered out into the wasteland, and it was here that he found what he was looking for.}{Pelojian was born to great wealth, but his spirit was that of a wandering mystic. It would not allow him to live a life of leisure. When, in his travels, he found only arrogance, greed, and the thirst for power among the sorcerers of his day, it troubled his soul greatly. He wandered out into the wasteland, and it was here that he found what he was looking for.}{}{16}{}{lf20 1}
{151}{What was he looking for?}{}{5}{}{160}{}
{160}{Clarity. A singular consciousness. A place he could start a new philosophy of magick. He gathered young, promising disciples around him and created this marvelous place, a beacon to all those that would pursue the ways of magick with a pure heart.}{Clarity. A singular consciousness. A place he could start a new philosophy of magick. He gathered young, promising disciples around him and created this marvelous place, a beacon to all those that would pursue the ways of magick with a pure heart.}{}{17}{}{}
